## Observation and scientific impact

`skills/replicate/references/assessment.md:99-101` requires a verified gap
and names missing outputs for partial coverage. Its table at line 185
nevertheless permits `scripts_accessibles` alone to derive Partially; lines
189-191 and 205 require blocked/unexamined provision to remain unassessed.
Replicator's `derive_table` at lines 161-164 applies the scripts-only rule;
its blocker loop at lines 196-201 preserves Partially despite blockers.
The local code therefore follows one side of a contradictory contract.

The frozen Blair provision dossier and the report supply empirical examples,
but this ticket does not recertify deposit completeness or accept I4R labels
as ground truth. Unknown coverage converted to a substantive category can
create both false agreements and false disagreements in validation.

## Bounded requested outcome

Resolve whether Partially means verified incomplete provision or a declared
inspected lower bound, and make every provision component consistent. Keep
positive inspected facts separately from unknown completeness. The received
proposal is to reserve categorical Partially for verified gaps; the final
interpretation must be explicit rather than silently inferred from presence
of any script. A new interpretation of a declared validation target is a
protocol decision, not authority granted by filing this ticket.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] Under one declared interpretation, unknown inventory stays unknown,
      a verified gap stays partial, and verified complete inventory stays full;
      blockers cannot silently certify a substantive completeness category.
- [ ] The four provision rows and corresponding criteria/evidence instructions
      express that interpretation consistently; inspected lower-bound facts
      remain visible.
- [ ] Independent unknown-inventory, blocked-inventory, verified-gap and
      complete-inventory controls establish those distinctions. Recheck the
      same frozen dossiers without overwriting prior observations before
      any new cohort is claimed as validation.

## Verification limits and scope

Receiver reproduced all four supplied 16-criterion controls and an independent
positive execution match control; 50 frozen deliverable hashes/sizes match
the existing freeze manifest. No full scientific rerun, new cohort, historical
package inventory certification, reference-label adjudication or held-out
accuracy claim. Source files and frozen dossiers were only read.
No skill rewrite is included in this filing. Adaptation tolerance and matching
output scope remain protocol questions in the source report, not extra defects
or newly authorized objectives. Tracker 1552 stays open.
